  {
    "name": "POST /api/Media + PUT /api/Media/complete - 上传视频素材(写操作·自清理，已用真实文件人工验证)",
    "description": "单接口测试：媒体上传两步流程，2026-09-14起真实执行。POST /api/Media发起上传返回Azure Blob SAS临时链接(uploadUrl)，需要把视频文件字节PUT到该链接(run-cases.py框架不支持二进制文件上传步骤，此步骤已用用户提供的真实mp4文件通过一次性脚本人工验证成功，HTTP 201)。本case的自动化步骤只覆盖create+complete+DELETE清理(JSON调用)：已实测complete在真正未上传字节的情况下仍返回200+新mediaId(说明complete阶段不同步校验blob是否存在，可能是异步处理)，为避免污染账号，complete后立即用Swagger里发现的DELETE /api/Media/{advertiserId}/{mediaId}接口清理(此接口此前生成case时被遗漏)。真实上传全流程(含字节上传)已人工验证一次：mediaId 55092 created→completed→deleted 全部成功。",
    "module": "Media",
    "granularity": "API",
    "since": "init",
    "last_modified": "init",
    "change_type": "NEW",
    "generated_by": "swagger-api-case",
    "steps": [
      {
        "name": "发起上传",
        "method": "POST",
        "base_url": "{{WALMARTBASEURL}}",
        "path": "Media",
        "request_body": {
          "advertiserId": 16274451,
          "mediaType": "video"
        },
        "extract_vars": {
          "media_upload_request_id": "data.mediaUploadRequestId"
        },
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200,
          "data": {
            "$not_empty": true
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "完成上传(未真实传字节，验证complete本身的JSON交互)",
        "method": "PUT",
        "base_url": "{{WALMARTBASEURL}}",
        "path": "Media/complete",
        "request_body": {
          "advertiserId": 16274451,
          "mediaUploadRequestId": "{{media_upload_request_id}}",
          "mediaName": "000test_media_upload"
        },
        "extract_vars": {
          "new_media_id": "data.mediaId"
        },
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200,
          "data.isSuccess": true
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "清理(DELETE，此接口原先生成case时遗漏)",
        "method": "DELETE",
        "base_url": "{{WALMARTBASEURL}}",
        "path": "Media/16274451/{{new_media_id}}",
        "request_body": {},
        "extract_vars": {},
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200
        }
      }
    ]
  }
